        "revenue contribution by each stablecoin not fully separated"
      ],
      "status": "best_supported_strategic_interpretation"
    },
    {
      "id": "H2_circle_distribution_diversification",
      "claim": "Circle is reducing dependence on any one exchange distributor by deepening Binance, Coinbase, SBI and Arc distribution.",
      "support": [
        "Circle-Coinbase agreement and distribution costs",
        "Binance $100M investment and five-year USDC deal",
        "SBI investment/JV and Japanese distribution",
        "Arc integrations"
      ],
      "disconfirming_or_unknown": [
        "relative distributor balances and economics after Q3 not yet available"
      ],
      "status": "supported_strategy_inference"
    },
    {
      "id": "H3_cbxrp_credit_utility",
      "claim": "cbXRP collateralization expands XRP utility and can encumber wrapped XRP without requiring sale of underlying native XRP.",
      "support": [
        "Coinbase 1:1 wrapper and custody policy",
        "Coinbase XRP-eligible Morpho loan product",
        "candidate cbXRP/USDC market"
      ],
      "disconfirming_or_unknown": [
        "exact Coinbase market mapping and onchain positions not independently reconstructed",
        "cbXRP minting may reflect conversion of existing holdings, not new spot demand"
      ],
      "status": "plausible_but_market_mapping_unverified"
    },
    {
      "id": "H4_sbi_transactional_xrp_use",
      "claim": "SBI Remit provides confirmed operational XRP bridge use in Japan-to-Southeast-Asia remittance corridors.",
      "support": [
        "SBI official announcement says SBI VC Trade sends XRP in real time and Tranglo pays local fiat"
      ],
      "disconfirming_or_unknown": [
        "throughput, average holding time, current corridor activity and net XRP inventory undisclosed"
      ],
      "status": "confirmed_use_case; economic_scale_unknown"
    },
    {
      "id": "H5_arc_competes_or_complements_xrpl",
      "claim": "Circle Arc may compete with XRPL for stablecoin payments/credit infrastructure while multichain USDC and RLUSD create complementary paths.",
      "support": [
        "Arc uses USDC as gas; SBI, Coinbase and Morpho participate",
        "USDC and RLUSD are available on XRPL",
        "Ripple says it intends to use USDC alongside RLUSD"
      ],
      "disconfirming_or_unknown": [
        "no comparative settlement volumes, pricing or institutional routing data"
      ],
      "status": "open_competing_hypotheses"
    },
    {
      "id": "H6_stablecoin_usage_means_xrp_demand",
      "claim": "More USDC/RLUSD usage on XRPL necessarily creates material XRP investment demand.",
      "support": [
        "XRP is native asset and transaction fee asset; DEX auto-bridging can use XRP"
      ],
      "disconfirming_or_unknown": [
        "stablecoin transfers do not all route through XRP",
        "transaction fees are small; actual bridge routing share and net inventory demand unknown"
      ],
      "status": "not_established"
    }
